# Vendored copy of the RustDesk client/server protocol library.
#
# origin:  https://github.com/rustdesk/hbb_common
# commit:  bb416bc94e48fa73046017f8ce4214324146cebe  (master on 2026-11-10; protocol used by RustDesk 1.5 clients:
#          IceCandidate, webrtc_sdp_offer/answer, KeyExchange v2)
#
# Starry's own edits are exactly libs/hbb_common.starry.patch (from the
# pristine commit above):
#   - Starry protobuf extensions (tags 60+ / 100+, never colliding with
#     upstream tags <= 29), see contracts/*/rendezvous-extension.proto;
#   - crates.io machine-uid 0.6 instead of a git dependency;
#   - drop the unmaintained dlopen dependency and re-export;
#   - users 0.11 -> uzers 0.12 (RUSTSEC-2023-0040, -2023-0059, -2025-0040).
#
# To re-vendor: export the new upstream commit into libs/hbb_common, run
#   git apply --directory=libs libs/hbb_common.starry.patch
# resolve any rejects by hand, regenerate the patch, and update this file.
